Subject: [PATCH] treble: Mark Samsung framework HIDL interfaces generic

Patched framework modules link Samsung radio and sysinput Java interfaces into the generic system image. Remove the system_ext-specific marker from their complete inheritance chains for Android 16 generic-image validation.

Generated with [Devin](https://devin.ai)

Co-Authored-By: Devin <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
